<title>UK: NatWest names new officer at Global Equities.</title>
<headline>NatWest names new officer at Global Equities.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Markets announced that Lou Ricciardelli has been appointed chief administrative officer and head of finance, technology and operations for Global Equities.</p>
<p>Ricciardelli, who will report to Tom Whelan, Global Equities' chief executive, was formerly president and CEO of BPB Associates, a consulting firm which specialises in financial services infrastructure.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
